    "description": "Audit and rewrite UI copy to remove AI slop — overlong button labels, hedging error messages, corporate filler, and passive voice in interface text. Use when asked to clean up UI text, deslop interface copy, fix AI-sounding buttons or error messages, audit microcopy for AI patterns, or humanize product UI. Trigger phrases: \"deslop\", \"anti-slop\", \"remove AI slop from UI\", \"clean up button labels\", \"fix error messages\", \"humanize interface text\", \"UI copy review\". NOT for writing new UI copy from scratch (use ux-writing). NOT for marketing or editorial prose (use deslop-copy). NOT for code quality cleanup (use ai-slop-cleaner).",
